'''Monstro II''' is a [[boss]] that can appear in the {{s|Depths}} and the {{s|Dank Depths}}.

== Behavior ==
* Hops towards Isaac, similar to {{e|Monstro}}.
* If Isaac is standing to the left or right side of Monstro II, he will shoot a horizontal {{i|Brimstone}} laser.
* Jumps off-screen and lands on Isaac's position two times in a row.
** Shoots 8 projectiles in all directions on his first landing. Each projectile deals a full heart of damage.
** Spawns 4 {{e|Sucker}}s on his second landing.
*** Suckers caught in Monstro II's hops, as well as his jump and his Brimstone attack, are killed.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|1}}: 20% smaller. Moves and attacks much faster, but only spawns 2 Suckers when landing. {{dlc|r}} Has 10% less HP (569.25).

